@startuml SEQ_02_REGISTER
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title SEQ-02 · Register\nAktor: Publik

actor       "Publik"                       as Publik
boundary    "Browser"                      as Browser
control     "RegisteredUserController"     as Controller
entity      "User Model"                   as Model
database    "users"                        as DB

note over Controller
  Middleware: guest
  (redirect ke dashboard jika sudah login)
end note

== Skenario A: Buka Halaman Register ==

Publik -> Browser  : Akses /register
Browser -> Controller : GET /register [middleware: guest]
Controller --> Browser : Inertia::render('Auth/Register')
Browser --> Publik : Tampil form registrasi

== Skenario B: Register Berhasil ==

Publik -> Browser  : Isi name, email, password, password_confirmation\n→ klik Register
Browser -> Controller : POST /register\n{name, email, password, password_confirmation}
Controller -> Controller : validate()\nname: required|string|max:255\nemail: required|lowercase|email|max:255|unique:users\npassword: required|confirmed|Password::defaults()
alt Validasi Gagal
  Controller --> Browser : 422 + errors
  Browser --> Publik     : Sorot field yang tidak valid
else Validasi Lolos
  Controller -> Model    : User::create({name, email,\npassword: Hash::make(password)})
  Model -> DB            : INSERT INTO users\n(name, email, password, created_at, ...)
  DB --> Model           : id user baru
  Controller -> Controller : event(new Registered($user))
  note right of Controller
    Event Registered memicu
    pengiriman email verifikasi
    (jika email verification aktif)
  end note
  Controller -> Controller : Auth::login($user)
  Controller -> Controller : $request->session()->regenerate()
  Controller --> Browser  : redirect(route('dashboard'))
  Browser --> Publik      : Masuk halaman Dashboard
end

@enduml
